Given this function, run on a graph stored as an adjacency list (dict of node -> list of neighbors):

```python
def bfs(graph, start):
    visited = {start}
    queue = deque([start])
    while queue:
        node = queue.popleft()
        for neighbor in graph.neighbors(node):
            if neighbor not in visited:
                visited.add(neighbor)
                queue.append(neighbor)
    return visited
```

